msgid "Official drivers and provider iteration"
msgstr "官方驱动与 provider 迭代"

msgid ""
"Use this contract when changing a SoC provider or integrating an official "
"driver. Nexus keeps static assembly, typed factories and public C11 I/O "
"contracts. Official HAL/LL code is private implementation input. This page "
"defines the integration boundary and work-package exits; it does not qualify"
" every external library, maintained mode, source revision or physical board."
msgstr ""
"修改 SoC provider 或接入官方驱动时使用本合同。Nexus 保留静态装配、typed factory 和公共 C11 I/O 合同。官方 "
"HAL/LL 代码是私有实现输入。本页规定接入边界与工作包退出条件，不代表全部外部库、维护模式、源码版本或实板都已取得资格。"

msgid ""
"![Current platform responsibilities and external product "
"boundary](../assets/diagrams/platform-architecture.svg)"
msgstr "![当前平台责任与外部产品边界](../assets/diagrams/platform-architecture.svg)"

msgid "Current platform responsibilities and external product boundary"
msgstr "当前平台责任与外部产品边界"

msgid ""
"FIG-01 remains the current responsibility diagram. Reusing official code "
"changes the private SoC implementation, not the public dependency direction."
" FIG-03 in [the architecture explanation](../explanation/platform-"
"architecture.md) shows the existing build-time generation path. Neither "
"diagram implies a new runtime registry, HAL manager, default worker or "
"mandatory OS layer."
msgstr ""
"FIG-01 继续表达当前责任边界。复用官方代码改变 SoC "
"私有实现，不改变公共依赖方向。[架构说明](../explanation/platform-architecture.md)中的 FIG-03 "
"展示现有构建期生成路径。这两张图均不表示新增运行时注册表、HAL 管理器、默认工作者或强制 OS 层。"

msgid "Implementation boundary"
msgstr "实现边界"

msgid ""
"The reviewed F4 dependency is STM32 HAL Driver v1.8.5 at "
"`b6f0ed3829f3829eb358a2e7417d80bba1a42db7`. Its CMSIS Device pairing comes "
"from STM32CubeF4 v1.28.3. The machine authority is [the official-driver "
"lock](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/dependencies/stm32f4-hal.lock.json), checked against the selected Git"
" dependency and imported SDK bytes. The lock records the reviewed LL headers"
" and license; it is not a declaration that all HAL modules are compiled, "
"supported or validated."
msgstr ""
"已审查的 F4 依赖是 STM32 HAL Driver v1.8.5，固定提交为 "
"`b6f0ed3829f3829eb358a2e7417d80bba1a42db7`。它与 CMSIS Device 的配对来自 STM32CubeF4"
" v1.28.3。机器权威是[官方驱动锁](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/dependencies/stm32f4-hal.lock.json)，校验时对照所选 Git 依赖与导入 "
"SDK 字节。锁文件记录已审查的 LL 头和许可证，不表示全部 HAL 模块均已编译、支持或验证。"

msgid ""
"The selected production approach uses official LL operations inside existing"
" F407 provider state machines. It retains request admission, absolute "
"deadlines, wire completion, cancellation, drain and quarantine. A full HAL "
"Handle/callback transport is a separate evaluation and must not be described"
" as an implemented platform-wide HAL migration. G4, H7 and U5 do not inherit"
" F4 support or dependency qualification. GD32 remains a separate provider."
msgstr ""
"所选生产方案在现有 F407 provider 状态机内使用官方 LL 操作，保留 request 准入、绝对 "
"deadline、线上完成、取消、排空与隔离。完整 HAL Handle/callback transport 是独立评估项，不能描述为已经实施的全平台"
" HAL 迁移。G4、H7、U5 不继承 F4 支持或依赖资格。GD32 继续使用独立 provider。"

msgid "Owner"
msgstr "责任方"

msgid "Responsibility"
msgstr "责任"

msgid "Official HAL/LL/CMSIS"
msgstr "官方 HAL/LL/CMSIS"

msgid "Reviewed hardware operations and selected vendor algorithms"
msgstr "已审查的硬件操作与所选厂商算法"

msgid "Family provider"
msgstr "家族 provider"

msgid "Exact peripheral behavior, private state, IRQ and error bridge"
msgstr "精确外设行为、私有状态、IRQ 与错误桥接"

msgid "Common I/O"
msgstr "公共 I/O"

msgid ""
"Admission, public results, borrowed storage and final publication contracts"
msgstr "准入、公共结果、借用存储与最终发布合同"

msgid "Generated Platform"
msgstr "生成的 Platform"

msgid ""
"Static context/face construction, resource acquisition and reverse cleanup"
msgstr "静态 context/face 构造、资源取得与逆序清理"

msgid "External product"
msgstr "外部产品"

msgid "Execution progress, workers, budgets, partitions and recovery policy"
msgstr "执行进度、工作者、预算、分区与恢复策略"

msgid ""
"Only one state machine may own a live peripheral operation. An adapter must "
"not run a HAL transfer engine and a second independent register engine over "
"the same interrupt flags or DMA channel. Mixed LL/register operations "
"require explicit ordering and ownership. Vendor types, mutable handles and "
"headers stay out of public interfaces. Factory lookup returns an existing "
"face without initializing hardware or allocating storage."
msgstr ""
"一个正在进行的外设操作只能由一个状态机拥有。适配器不得让 HAL 传输引擎与另一套独立寄存器引擎同时处理相同中断标志或 DMA 通道。混合 "
"LL/寄存器操作必须明确顺序与所有权。厂商类型、可变 Handle 和头文件不得进入公共接口。factory 查找返回已有 "
"face，不初始化硬件或分配存储。"

msgid "Build-time provider contract"
msgstr "构建期 provider 合同"

msgid ""
"Each constructor returns the frozen `Construction` record from [provider "
"common contracts](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/providers/common.py). It names "
"`state_type`, `definitions`, `initialize`, `stop`, `retain_on_failed_init`, "
"`exports` and `pin_snapshots`. The common emitter consumes these decisions "
"rather than reconstructing state types or failed-init responsibility from a "
"family name. This is a Python generation contract; no descriptor or dispatch"
" layer is emitted into the MCU image."
msgstr ""
"每个构造器返回[provider 公共合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/providers/common.py)中的冻结 `Construction`"
" 记录，明确给出 "
"`state_type`、`definitions`、`initialize`、`stop`、`retain_on_failed_init`、`exports`"
" 和 `pin_snapshots`。公共生成器消费这些决策，不再从家族名称重建状态类型或初始化失败责任。这是 Python 生成合同，不会向 MCU "
"镜像增加描述符或分派层。"

msgid ""
"The family owns numerical limits, supported modes, exact routes and "
"construction semantics. The resolver owns strict fields, immutable inputs "
"and resource conflicts. CMake owns source selection and target dependencies."
" Preserve these separate authorities: generation must not create a second "
"source build graph, and a syntactically valid configuration must not imply "
"unimplemented hardware."
msgstr ""
"家族负责数值限制、支持模式、精确路线与构造语义；resolver 负责严格字段、不可变输入和资源冲突；CMake "
"负责源码选择和目标依赖。必须保留这些独立权威：生成器不得创建第二份源码构建图，配置语法正确也不能表示尚未实现的硬件已经可用。"

msgid "Conditions for full HAL transport"
msgstr "完整 HAL transport 的接入条件"

msgid ""
"Before accepting a Handle-based mode, establish a progressing time source "
"for every HAL wait it can reach. Review bootstrap clock waits, "
"`HAL_GetTick`, tick reinitialization and interrupt-priority grouping. Do not"
" let default HAL startup silently acquire SysTick or change OS policy. "
"Public operations consume one absolute monotonic deadline, including queue "
"and preparation time."
msgstr ""
"接受基于 Handle 的模式前，为其可能进入的每个 HAL 等待建立能够推进的时源。审查 bootstrap "
"时钟等待、`HAL_GetTick`、tick 重新初始化和中断优先级分组。不得让默认 HAL 启动静默取得 SysTick 或改变 OS "
"策略。公共操作使用同一个绝对单调 deadline，包含排队和准备时间。"

msgid ""
"Establish request identity and borrowed references before enabling hardware "
"or calling an API that can invoke a callback synchronously. Callback bridges"
" publish bounded facts and optional wake hints; they do not execute "
"arbitrary product callbacks. Check the complete HAL call stack before "
"publishing settlement or allowing reentrant submission. A HAL lock is not a "
"task mutex or a controller ownership policy."
msgstr ""
"启用硬件或调用可能同步触发回调的 API 前，先建立 request "
"身份与借用引用。回调桥只发布有界事实和可选唤醒提示，不执行任意产品回调。发布结清或允许重入提交前，必须检查完整 HAL 调用栈。HAL lock "
"不是任务互斥锁，也不能代替控制器所有权策略。"

msgid ""
"![Reference finite-DMA completion and failure "
"responsibilities](../assets/diagrams/dma-completion.svg)"
msgstr "![有限 DMA 完成与失败责任参考](../assets/diagrams/dma-completion.svg)"

msgid "Reference finite-DMA completion and failure responsibilities"
msgstr "有限 DMA 完成与失败责任参考"

msgid ""
"FIG-07 is the existing F407 finite-DMA reference. DMA completion, wire "
"completion, HAL internal readiness and Nexus settlement remain different "
"facts. Preserve the [public ownership "
"contract](../explanation/ownership.md): abort or timeout starts withdrawal; "
"it does not return storage. Detach every required hardware, IRQ and queue "
"reference before the provider's final release-publication of `SETTLED`. "
"Failed drain retains `QUARANTINED` storage and an explicit recovery "
"obligation. Circular DMA must never overwrite a consumer-owned block to "
"emulate progress."
msgstr ""
"FIG-07 是既有 F407 有限 DMA 参考。DMA 完成、线上完成、HAL 内部就绪与 Nexus "
"结清仍是不同事实。保留[公共所有权合同](../explanation/ownership.md)：abort 或 timeout "
"启动撤回，不归还存储。provider 最终以 release 发布 `SETTLED` 前，先撤回全部必要硬件、IRQ 与队列引用。排空失败保留 "
"`QUARANTINED` 存储和明确恢复责任。循环 DMA 不得覆盖消费者持有的块来模拟进展。"

msgid "Caller-owned lifecycle diagnostics"
msgstr "调用方存储的生命周期诊断"

msgid ""
"Generated headers expose `nx_platform_diagnostic_t` and the optional "
"`nx_platform_start_diagnosed` / `nx_platform_stop_diagnosed` entries. The "
"original start/stop entry points remain available. A null diagnostic pointer"
" uses the original behavior; a nonnull pointer supplies caller-owned cold-"
"path output and is never retained. It adds no static registry, labels or "
"default instance RAM. Cold code/stack cost still belongs in the linked-image"
" comparison."
msgstr ""
"生成的头提供 `nx_platform_diagnostic_t` 和可选 `nx_platform_start_diagnosed` / "
"`nx_platform_stop_diagnosed` 入口，原 start/stop "
"入口继续可用。空诊断指针使用原行为；非空指针提供调用方拥有的冷路径输出，不会被保留。它不增加静态注册表、标签或默认实例 "
"RAM。冷路径代码和栈成本仍需要纳入实际链接镜像比较。"

msgid ""
"`phase` and `cleanup_phase` distinguish `NONE`, `CONTEXT`, `SYSTEM`, "
"`RESOURCES` and `CONTROLLER`. A controller phase carries its zero-based "
"index in `resolved.json.controllers`; it is not a per-kind factory ID. "
"`SIZE_MAX` means no controller. Successful calls clear the diagnostic. A "
"failed start records the primary location and, if cleanup fails, a separate "
"cleanup location. Existing primary result, cleanup result and remaining "
"effects remain authoritative; diagnostics neither perform recovery nor "
"establish that a retained borrow ended."
msgstr ""
"`phase` 与 `cleanup_phase` 区分 `NONE`、`CONTEXT`、`SYSTEM`、`RESOURCES` 和 "
"`CONTROLLER`。controller 阶段携带其在 `resolved.json.controllers` 中的零基索引，不是各 kind 的"
" factory ID。`SIZE_MAX` 表示没有 "
"controller。调用成功清空诊断；启动失败记录主要位置，清理失败时另记录清理位置。既有主要结果、清理结果与剩余效果继续是权威；诊断不执行恢复，也不证明保留的借用已经结束。"

msgid "Work-package exits and existing authorities"
msgstr "工作包退出条件与既有权威"

msgid ""
"The following table assigns exits to the iteration work packages. It is a "
"design checklist, not a second support or completion database. Current "
"support continues to come from [the derived capability "
"matrix](../delivery/capabilities.md), exact provider facts and reviewed "
"fixtures. Existing ledgers retain original IDs, statuses and evidence; do "
"not relabel historical results as new-source execution."
msgstr ""
"下表为迭代工作包规定退出条件，是设计检查表，不是第二份支持或完成数据库。当前支持继续来自[派生能力矩阵](../delivery/capabilities.md)、精确"
" provider facts 和已审查夹具。既有台账保留原始 ID、状态与证据，不得把历史结果重标为新源码执行。"

msgid "Work package"
msgstr "工作包"

msgid "Exit and maintained authority"
msgstr "退出条件与维护权威"

msgid "Configuration and provider contract"
msgstr "配置与 provider 合同"

msgid ""
"Explicit construction and failed-init responsibility; deterministic "
"generation and rejection tests; [integration contract](integration-"
"contracts.md)"
msgstr "明确构造与初始化失败责任；确定性生成及拒绝测试；[接入合同](integration-contracts.md)"

msgid "Official driver reuse"
msgstr "官方驱动复用"

msgid ""
"Locked source/license/pairing, private build and SDK closure, mode-specific "
"real-driver tests; [source compatibility](source-compatibility.md)"
msgstr "锁定来源、许可证与配对，私有构建和 SDK 闭包，逐模式真实驱动测试；[源码兼容性](source-compatibility.md)"

msgid "Hardware/resource description"
msgstr "硬件与资源描述"

msgid ""
"Exact pins, IRQ, DMA, clocks and memory; no invented Board wiring or silent "
"fallback; [SoC ledger](soc-refinement.md)"
msgstr ""
"精确 pins、IRQ、DMA、clock 与 memory；不虚构 Board 接线，不静默回退；[SoC 台账](soc-"
"refinement.md)"

msgid "Lifecycle and diagnostics"
msgstr "生命周期与诊断"

msgid ""
"Every partial effect either withdrawn or retained; caller-owned cold "
"diagnostics never revoke a borrow; [lifecycle matrix](io-lifecycle-"
"matrix.md)"
msgstr "部分效果要么撤回，要么继续保留；调用方存储的冷路径诊断不撤销借用；[生命周期矩阵](io-lifecycle-matrix.md)"

msgid "I/O ownership"
msgstr "I/O 所有权"

msgid ""
"Real acceptance, cancel, late IRQ, overflow, instance isolation and drain "
"regressions; [I/O recovery contract](io-observation-recovery.md)"
msgstr "真实接受、取消、晚到 IRQ、溢出、实例隔离与排空回归；[I/O 恢复合同](io-observation-recovery.md)"

msgid "Arch, OS and components"
msgstr "Arch、OS 与组件"

msgid ""
"Exact backend/CPU scope, unchanged masks, explicit execution and "
"wait/observer shutdown; [OS contract](os-contracts.md)"
msgstr ""
"精确 backend/CPU 范围、不改变输入 mask、显式执行与 wait/observer 退出；[OS 合同](os-contracts.md)"

msgid "Performance and resources"
msgstr "性能与资源"

msgid ""
"Same configuration/toolchain/workload comparison, actual ELF/RAM/stack "
"reports; [execution budgets](soc-execution-budgets.md)"
msgstr "同配置、工具链和负载比较，真实 ELF/RAM/stack 报告；[执行预算](soc-execution-budgets.md)"

msgid "Test plan and HIL"
msgstr "测试计划与 HIL"

msgid ""
"Reviewed applicability plus fresh executed results; software and physical "
"status separate; [qualification](../delivery/qualification.md)"
msgstr "审查适用范围并取得新鲜执行结果，软件与物理状态分别记录；[资格合同](../delivery/qualification.md)"

msgid "External consumption and documentation"
msgstr "外部消费与文档"

msgid ""
"Relocated Source SDK consumer, external examples and complete reviewed "
"English/Chinese pages; {download}`build ledger <build-system-execution.csv>`"
" and {download}`documentation ledger <documentation-system-execution.csv>`"
msgstr ""
"搬移后的 Source SDK consumer、外部示例以及完整已审英文与中文页面；{download}`构建台账 <build-system-"
"execution.csv>`和{download}`文档台账 <documentation-system-execution.csv>`"

msgid ""
"The read-only work-package view joins existing provider, capability, SDK-"
"required source and reviewed lifecycle-test authorities. It retains exact "
"scopes and shows unmapped properties instead of inventing aliases. It does "
"not execute tests, verify a complete installed SDK or establish "
"software/physical qualification. See [maintenance "
"tools](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tools/maintenance/README.md) for the actual command and output "
"limits."
msgstr ""
"只读工作包视图关联既有 provider、能力、SDK "
"必需源码和已审生命周期测试权威。它保留精确范围，展示未映射属性，不虚构别名。它不执行测试、不验证完整已安装 "
"SDK，也不建立软件或物理资格。实际命令与输出限制见[维护工具](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/maintenance/README.md)。"

msgid "Comparison and replacement"
msgstr "比较与替换"

msgid ""
"Compare official and existing implementations with the same chip, clock, "
"memory, route, mode, capacity, OS, compiler, optimization and workload. "
"Record Flash LOAD and footprint separately, per-domain static RAM, caller-"
"owned storage, stack reservation versus measured peak, IRQ/service behavior "
"and cleanup failures. Operation counts and host timings are not physical "
"cycles, latency or WCET."
msgstr ""
"比较官方与既有实现时，固定芯片、clock、memory、route、mode、capacity、OS、compiler、optimization 和 "
"workload。分别记录 Flash LOAD 与 footprint、各域静态 RAM、调用方存储、预留栈与实测峰值、IRQ/service "
"行为和清理失败。操作次数与主机耗时不是物理 cycles、latency 或 WCET。"

msgid ""
"Retain an old implementation only while it provides a needed comparison or "
"an unreplaced maintained mode. Select one normal production implementation "
"after its contract and costs are accepted; remove unused switches and "
"duplicate state. A dedicated LL/register path is justified by a demonstrated"
" semantic gap or measured budget, not by a general assertion that vendor "
"code is slow."
msgstr ""
"只有仍需对照或存在未替代维护模式时才保留旧实现。合同与成本验收后，选定一个正常生产实现，删除无用开关和重复状态。专用 "
"LL/寄存器路径需要已证明的语义差距或实测预算依据，不能只笼统声称厂商代码慢。"

msgid "Validation and delivery boundary"
msgstr "验证与交付边界"

msgid ""
"New behavior follows RED, GREEN and refactor with the normal commit/CI "
"gates. Host C tests use GoogleTest/GoogleMock; tool tests use stdlib "
"unittest. Mock an external port when checking the adapter contract, then "
"separately execute real official code with the adapter. ARM links establish "
"selected image/resource properties. Real equipment is required for IRQ "
"timing, DMA/Cache coherence, electrical behavior and long-load conclusions."
msgstr ""
"新增行为按 RED、GREEN、refactor 实施，并通过正常 commit/CI 门禁。主机 C 测试使用 "
"GoogleTest/GoogleMock，工具测试使用 stdlib unittest。适配合同测试可以 mock "
"外部端口，然后还要单独执行真实官方代码与适配器。ARM 链接证明所选镜像与资源性质；IRQ 时序、DMA/Cache "
"一致性、电气行为和长期负载结论需要真实设备。"

msgid ""
"A software candidate still requires clean source, exact "
"dependency/configuration identity, independent SDK consumption and two fresh"
" network-disabled builds of the same artifacts. No iteration checklist or "
"derived work-package report grants that status. Existing release tags/assets"
" and original evidence remain immutable. Without connected boards, HIL stays"
" `not_executed`; do not call a software-only iteration a product release or "
"safety qualification."
msgstr ""
"软件候选仍要求 clean source、精确依赖和配置身份、独立 SDK "
"消费，以及同产物的两次全新断网构建。迭代检查表或派生工作包报告均不授予这一状态。既有 release "
"tag、附件和原始证据保持不可变。没有连接实板时，HIL 保持 `not_executed`，不得把纯软件迭代称为产品发布或安全资格。"

msgid ""
"Bootloader handoff, dynamic reclocking, deep STOP, broader H743 DMA and "
"generic U575 cross-domain I/O retain their separate unimplemented or partial"
" exits in the [SoC refinement ledger](soc-refinement.md). Official drivers "
"do not automatically supply the platform contracts for these features."
msgstr ""
"Bootloader 交接、动态变频、deep STOP、更广的 H743 DMA 和通用 U575 跨域 I/O，继续保留[SoC "
"完善台账](soc-refinement.md)中各自未实现或部分实现的退出条件。官方驱动不会自动提供这些功能需要的平台合同。"


# CMSIS6 actual-POT delta; independent review pending.
msgid "CMSIS Device pairing is separate from the shared Arm CMSIS-Core source. The Core migration pins official v6.4.0 for the seven maintained STM32/GD32 family entries while keeping their Device/startup, HAL/LL and imported vendor bytes. The internal `nexus_cmsis_core` target supplies CPU headers; it does not change public Nexus types, Arch context/ownership contracts or the selected peripheral state machine. [Vendor versions](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/vendors/VERSIONS.md) distinguishes the release, Core version macros, literal pack metadata and license identities. Actual include closure, firmware links and installed-SDK consumption require current-source evidence; a common Core pin does not transfer F4 qualification to G4, H7, U5 or GD32."
msgstr "CMSIS Device 配对与共享的 Arm CMSIS-Core 来源分别维护。Core 迁移为七个维护中的 STM32/GD32 family 入口锁定官方 v6.4.0，同时保持各自的 Device/startup、HAL/LL 和供应商导入字节。内部 `nexus_cmsis_core` 目标提供 CPU 头，不改变公共 Nexus 类型、Arch 上下文／所有权合同或已选外设状态机。[供应商版本](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/vendors/VERSIONS.md)分别记录发布版本、Core 版本宏、原始 pack 元数据和许可证身份。实际 include 闭包、固件链接和安装后 SDK 消费都需要当前源码的执行证据；使用同一 Core pin 不会把 F4 的资格转移给 G4、H7、U5 或 GD32。"
